{"schemaVersion":1,"release":"20261114-evidence1","scope":"Three bounded number-state learning panels, structure-source handoff into explicit representation calculations, and an official Cu thermal-file workflow.","counts":{"oscillatorLessons":3,"oscillatorPlacements":3,"cuInputCellAtoms":4,"cuRows":251},"hooks":{"scattering-temperature":["ladder-weights"],"polaron-hamiltonian":["vacuum-motion"],"polaron-truncation":["finite-boundary"]},"verification":["Independent number-state sums and matrices check amplitudes, probabilities, separately weighted tails, microscopic reverse transitions and finite-boundary commutators against the fixed references and the existing Python API.","Course integration preserves disclosures, unfinished responses, notes and original calculator drafts; explicit copying preserves the exact chosen temperature and waits for manual calculation.","Strict source metadata preserves file/text hash identity, tolerances, basis/origin and wavevector transforms and single/double-valued selection through workbench export and explicitly saved research records. Changed requests cannot inherit unrelated source metadata.","Official Cu source bytes, lossless XZ decompression, input-cell normalization and all thermal rows are checked. Import loading, replacement, cancellation and stale completion are exercised through actual form handlers."],"boundaries":["Fixed teaching references do not introduce a general oscillator or scattering solver. Holstein vacuum and numerical truncation panels do not infer a finite-temperature polaron state.","A source checksum identifies the parsed source; it is not an electronic-structure calculation or magnetic-order detector. Imported metadata cannot independently reverify absent original bytes. Numerical representation validity and standard-label coverage remain separate.","Cu thermal_properties data describe one official calculated four-atom input cell at one volume. They do not supply eigenvectors, measured data, full quasi-harmonic volume predictions or a newly performed material calculation.","This release covers three learning hooks and representative source workflows. Broader curriculum depth, diagnosis and authentic workflows for every tool family remain open."],"files":{"GOAL-ROADMAP.md":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":19015,"sha256":"88338d583254ec51702a2f72bd2d796967284889e3b57ee082205ca00d0a37d3"},"dist/app.js":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":97272,"sha256":"43c38865d6799f9b12d7b07dc37b6e2fdc686c2d1f2be6918bb89742698d2e53"},"dist/bridges-ui.js":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":17152,"sha256":"6e67ce5402be0bbf804faa13409836cd9e6c96ae58e25e10d83ef46aeaefe8e6"},"dist/data/examples/phonopy-cu-LICENSE.txt":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":1470,"sha256":"2ce26839c8b70d28765d73e934cc1a979d896d8d228d30694fdd9a92e94d43a9"},"dist/data/examples/phonopy-cu-thermal-index05.yaml":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":41975,"sha256":"1c9e6edeeded194fc7eebe9c4f4bd6e88728b48ea4f530a033240f8394267bf1"},"dist/data/examples/phonopy-cu-thermal-index05.yaml.xz":{"normalization":"raw-bytes","bytes":4900,"sha256":"36c87fc5560cc7815cd9d97105830c00cffa4a3a2fb486235d7976bc493ebb1f"},"dist/data/examples/phonopy-cu-thermal-source.json":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":2907,"sha256":"903330e565a126b3e8d30b09099ce1a352fbf0703c9d98e4cf2344e56941763f"},"dist/docs/cu-thermal-example.md":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":4040,"sha256":"69155f09dba2ab02a9a59e71a7f55b2a16ebf5bf177b295c1144eb892027a017"},"dist/index.html":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":6649,"sha256":"34e4661ad40f45bb430a18f121eaa8bc8f4ef39ef9004d6c8cfed39398d2d87c"},"dist/learning-bridge-host.js":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":3318,"sha256":"082e9ffe2ac591d35bf1004490a6a772fe3578c357da9e903bcd963583002f64"},"dist/material-notebook.js":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":23575,"sha256":"2efe47839fdb9edbbd1dbf68923f82221de186ee0086c5d5d97895612817be8f"},"dist/material-research-ui.js":{"normalization":"utf